    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>reCAPTCHA (v2 &amp; v3) for Asgaros Forum</strong> is a free plugin/add-on for Asgaros Forum, that allow you to easily add <strong>Google reCAPTCHA v2</strong> or <strong>Google reCAPTCHA v3</strong> on your Asgaros Forum.</p>\n<p><strong>reCAPTCHA (v2 &amp; v3) for Asgaros Forum</strong> prevent spam from creating new topics or replies. This plugin is built to integrate seamlessly with your Asgaros Forum enabled WordPress website.</p>\n<p><strong>reCAPTCHA (v2 &amp; v3) for Asgaros Forum</strong> is very easy to use and work for <strong>guest users</strong> as well as <strong>Logged-in users</strong>.</p>\n<h4>Premium Features</h4>\n<p>Upgrade to Pro to unlock additional CAPTCHA providers and advanced spam protection features.</p>\n<p>Pro version currently includes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cloudflare Turnstile support</li>\n</ul>\n<p>More premium anti-spam features are planned for future releases.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor improvements</li>\n</ul>\n<p>= 1.1.0<br />\n* Authorized access fix</p>\n<p>= 1.1.0<br />\n* Security fixes</p>\n<h4>1.0.8</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Testing on new version</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.7</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor bug fix</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Delete data on deactivation</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>reCAPTCHA V3 validation fix</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added new languages for v2 checkbox</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added reCAPTCHA V3 Support</li>\n<li>Fixed error message on invalid captcha</li>\n<li>Code optimized</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "A free plugin (add-on) for Asgaros Forum that allow you to easily add Google reCAPTCHA v2 or Google reCAPTCHA v3 on your Asgaros Forum.",
